morning|early-part-of-day|NOUN|Early part of the day|The part of the day from around sunrise until noon.|buổi sáng|We spent the morning sketching the boats near the harbour.|Chúng tôi dành buổi sáng phác họa những chiếc thuyền gần cảng.|In the morning, but on Monday morning; this morning without a preposition.|0
rock|move-gently-back-and-forth|VERB|Move gently back and forth|To move, or make something move, repeatedly backwards and forwards or from side to side.|đung đưa; lắc qua lại|The empty boat rocked gently beside the wooden landing stage.|Chiếc thuyền trống đung đưa nhẹ bên bến gỗ.|Transitive rock a cradle or intransitive a boat rocks; rocked, rocking.|0
rock|solid-mineral-material|NOUN|Solid mineral material or a piece of it|Hard natural material forming part of the earth, or a piece of that material.|đá; tảng đá|A large rock blocked part of the narrow path.|Một tảng đá lớn chắn một phần lối đi hẹp.|Uncountable for material, countable for a piece; rock formations, a rock.|1
rock|popular-music-style|NOUN|Popular music style|A style of popular music often using electric guitars, drums and a strong beat.|nhạc rock|The band played rock at the community festival.|Ban nhạc chơi nhạc rock tại lễ hội cộng đồng.|Uncountable; rock music, a rock band. A rock is not normally one song.|2
today|on-the-current-day|ADVERB|On the current day|On the day when the speaker is speaking.|hôm nay|The parcel arrived today instead of tomorrow.|Bưu kiện đến hôm nay thay vì ngày mai.|Usually without a preposition; today, not on today. Can appear at the beginning or end of a clause.|0
today|the-current-day|NOUN|The current day|The day on which the speaker is speaking.|ngày hôm nay|Today's programme includes a tour of the old mill.|Chương trình hôm nay bao gồm một chuyến tham quan cối xay cũ.|Possessive today's; by today, until today. Separate the noun construction from the adverbial use.|1
writer|person-who-writes|NOUN|Person who writes|A person who creates written works such as books, articles or scripts.|người viết; nhà văn|The writer interviewed local residents before starting her novel.|Nhà văn phỏng vấn người dân địa phương trước khi bắt đầu viết tiểu thuyết.|Countable; a travel writer, a script writer. Author commonly refers to the creator of a particular work.|0
kitchen|room-for-food-preparation|NOUN|Room for food preparation|A room or area where food is prepared and cooked.|nhà bếp; bếp|The kitchen has a wide counter beside the sink.|Nhà bếp có một mặt bàn rộng cạnh bồn rửa.|Countable; a kitchen, kitchen equipment. In the kitchen is the usual location phrase.|0
